# Recolours Kvantum's KvFlatLight (kvconfig and SVG) to the light wallpaper palette; wallpaper/palettes.nix applies it with
# sed. The light greys of the SVG become surface steps, the mid greys outline, the dark ones text; the blues become the
# accent and its container. Black strokes and shadows (#000) stay black.
